Comment: 0,0:00:48.02,0:00:48.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,OP
Comment: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:55.00,Blau drei E,,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 10,0:00:03.81,0:00:05.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's our next class again?}¿Cuál será nuestra próxima clase?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.27,0:00:06.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Math?}¿Matemáticas?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.48,0:00:08.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Nos irá a servir de algo algún día?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.94,0:00:09.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I know, right?}Sí, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.61,0:00:13.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, don't touch the do!}¡Oye, no me toques!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.83,0:00:18.79,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Every time our eyes met,}Cada vez que nuestras miradas se cruzaban,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.91,0:00:23.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{we averted our gazes at first...}volvíamos la vista a otro lado...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.96,0:00:29.25,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...and then looked back at each other.}... y luego nos volvíamos a mirar.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.30,0:00:34.84,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{That was me and Kou in our first year of middle school.}Así eramos en nuestro primer año de secundaria.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.30,0:00:38.30,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{No one knows...}Nadie sabe...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.64,0:00:42.93,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...about our awkward days together.}... sobre nuestros embarazosos días.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.32,0:02:20.45,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I want to see Kou.}Quiero ver a Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.28,0:02:23.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I want to talk to Kou!}¡Quiero hablar con Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.25,0:02:28.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The advanced track's shoe lockers...}Los casilleros de estudiantes avanzados...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.58,0:02:30.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Who're you looking for?}¿A quién buscas?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.88,0:02:37.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.18,0:02:42.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I've been looking for you.}Te estaba buscando.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.30,0:02:44.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{There's something I want to talk to you about.}Quería hablar de algo contigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.18,0:02:47.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What, you make up with your friends or something?}¿Qué? ¿Te reconciliaste con tus amigas o algo así?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.14,0:02:50.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Nah, that plan went down the drain.}No, ya no sirve de nada eso.{no sé, yo pondría que se fue todo al carajo (?}{<}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.23,0:02:55.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But you know, sometimes things just don't go your way.}Pero, ya sabes, las cosas no siempre salen como quieres.{nee?}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.40,0:02:57.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That's when you go back to step one.}Así que comenzaré desde cero.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.61,0:03:00.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And there's nothing wrong with that.}¡Creo que es lo mejor!{no hay nada malo>}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.03,0:03:04.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm glad.}Me alegro.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.99,0:03:07.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.91,0:03:12.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I wasn't done talking to you yet...}Todavía no terminaba de hablar contigo...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.67,0:03:14.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're the girl from before!}¡Eres la chica de antes!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.50,0:03:16.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, hey there.}Oh, hola.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.63,0:03:19.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What more do you have to say?}¿Tienes algo más que decir?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.47,0:03:20.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Get off my case.}No molestes.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.84,0:03:23.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No, this is something else.}No, es por otra cosa.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.26,0:03:28.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm coming over to make dinner today, so make sure you're home.}Iré a cenar a tu casa hoy, \Nasí que asegúrate de estar ahí.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.56,0:03:33.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll be staying the night, too.}También me quedaré a dormir.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.44,0:03:34.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Staying?!}¡¿A dormir?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.69,0:03:37.32,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Wait, all night?}¿Pasarán la noche juntos?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.32,0:03:39.99,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Th-They're in that kind of relationship?}¿T-Tienen ese tipo de relación?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.57,0:03:43.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Stupid, what are you imagining?}Idiota, ¿qué tanto te imaginas?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.03,0:03:47.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We're brothers.}Somos hermanos.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.00,0:03:53.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's not a secret or anything, but we don't go out of our way to tell people either.}No es que lo mantengamos en secreto,\N pero tampoco es que debamos gritarlo.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.92,0:03:56.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Most people have no idea.}Casi nadie lo sabe.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.63,0:04:00.80,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Brothers?! No wonder they look alike!}¡¿Hermanos?! ¡Con razón se parecen tanto!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.80,0:04:03.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So, are you two dating?}Entonces ¿están saliendo?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.14,0:04:08.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Excuse me? You really think I'd date a pig who eats more than me?}¿Qué?{No da para ponerle cerdo D:} ¿En serio crees que saldría con alguien que come más que yo?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.60,0:04:12.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're the one who said you liked me back in middle school!}¡Tú dijiste que te gustaba en secundaria!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.31,0:04:14.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wasn't that you?}¿No lo dijiste tú?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.98,0:04:17.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You said you liked me back!}¡Dijiste que te gustaba!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.32,0:04:19.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, that time? You thought I was serious?}Oh, ¿esa vez? Era broma, era broma.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.90,0:04:21.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I just went with the flow.}Solo me dejé llevar.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.11,0:04:24.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What?! We gazed at each other all the time back then too!}¡¿Qué?! ¡Vivíamos mirándonos en ese entonces!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.86,0:04:27.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Only 'cause you kept staring at me.}Era solo porque tú me mirabas.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.91,0:04:32.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How stupid.}Qué estupidez.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.16,0:04:34.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{In any case, none of that matters now.}Como sea, ya no importa nada de eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.71,0:04:35.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't run!}¡No huyas!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.13,0:04:39.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{One way or another, you two seem to get along well.}De alguna manera u otra, \Nustedes dos parecen llevarse bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.92,0:04:42.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Anyway, what's your name?}¿Cómo te llamas?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.34,0:04:44.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka Futaba.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.30,0:04:46.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That's a nice name.}Qué bonito nombre.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.84,0:04:48.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Futaba, eh.}Futaba, ¿eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.18,0:04:51.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Futaba?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.27,0:04:52.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.39,0:04:58.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh! You're Futaba-san!}¡Oh! ¡Tú eres Futaba-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.44,0:05:01.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{There's a teacher hitting on a student over here.}Por acá un profesor está acosando a una alumna.{violencia 0}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.74,0:05:06.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wait, he's joking!\fad(0,200)}¡Esperen, está bromeando!{simplemente dice que no es así}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.79,0:05:14.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Come on, I wouldn't do that!}¡Vamos, no es así!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.75,0:05:19.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Geez...}Cielos...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.71,0:05:22.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So she's Yoshioka Futaba.}Entonces ella es Yoshioka Futaba.
