Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.35,0:05:36.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka Futaba.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.81,0:05:38.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Who's that?}¿Quién es?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.40,0:05:42.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't look!}¡No mires!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.28,0:05:44.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What, is she your crush?}¿Qué? ¿Estás enamorado?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.28,0:05:45.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just leave me alone!}{¡Déjame solo!}¡Qué molesto eres!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.95,0:05:51.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I see now.}Ya veo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.45,0:05:57.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It sounds like you and Tanaka-sensei don't live together.}Entonces Tanaka-sensei no vive contigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.00,0:06:02.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He teaches at the school I go to, so you'd think so.}Es profesor de nuestra escuela, \Nes normal que no vivamos juntos.{Commie}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.80,0:06:05.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Do you have your own place then?}{¿Tú solo te mudaste?}¿Estás viviendo solo?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.13,0:06:07.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No, but my brother does.}No, pero mi hermano sí.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.76,0:06:10.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So are you back at your old house now?}Entonces ¿vives en tu antigua casa?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.10,0:06:13.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{With your mom?}¿Con tu mamá?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.64,0:06:15.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's just me.}Solo yo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.89,0:06:17.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why don't you change your name back...}¿Por qué no usas tu nombre—
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.15,0:06:21.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Haven't you had enough?}¿No fue mucho ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.44,0:06:25.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just shut up. It's none of your business.}Qué molesta eres. Nada de eso es asunto tuyo.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.57,0:06:30.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You can't say that when you're literally dragging me in.}N-No puedes decir eso cuando eres el que me está arrastrando.{~}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.08,0:06:41.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I let go, so stop asking.}Ya te solté, ahora deja de preguntar.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.29,0:06:44.34,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.84,0:06:46.92,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Why...}¿Por qué...?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.26,0:06:51.84,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{We're looking straight at each other...}Nos miramos directamente...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.01,0:06:55.97,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...but it feels like he's staring right through me.}pero se siente como si yo fuera transparente.{podría decirlo de otra manera}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.85,0:07:01.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Didn't you just ask me to let you go?}¿No me pediste que te soltara?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.44,0:07:06.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Get off of me.}Entonces, quítate de encima.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.44,0:07:11.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Where did your feelings go, Kou?}¿Dónde{¿Adónde} quedaron tus sentimientos, Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.16,0:07:18.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Y-You disappear without a trace \Nand now you come back out of nowhere...}D-Desapareciste sin dejar rastro, y ahora apareces de la nada...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.66,0:07:23.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{There are so many questions I want to ask!}¡Hay tantas preguntas que quiero hacerte!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.09,0:07:28.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{There are so many thoughts running through my head I don't know what to do!}¡Tantas cosas cruzan por mi mente que no sé qué hacer!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.14,0:07:34.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't cry.}No llores.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.51,0:07:37.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I told you it was annoying.}Te dije que me molesta.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.23,0:07:41.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry.}Perdón.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.98,0:07:46.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.44,0:07:47.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{On the day of that summer festival...}El día del festival de verano...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.11,0:07:54.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Were you waiting for me at Triangle Park?}¿me estuviste esperando... en el Parque Sankaku?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.75,0:08:06.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I was waiting...}Estuve esperando...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.09,0:08:09.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I've always been waiting for you!}¡Estuve esperando que llegaras!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.22,0:08:13.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry.}Perdón.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.34,0:08:18.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I always thought... that you hated guys.}Siempre pensé... que odiabas a los chicos.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.31,0:08:19.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I was just...}Simplemente...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.68,0:08:25.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No, even so... I was still going to meet you at Triangle Park.}No, aun así... iba a ir al Parque Sankaku para vernos.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.15,0:08:30.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Pero apenas comenzaron las vacaciones, hubo problemas en mi familia.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.07,0:08:32.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Lots of stuff happened.}Muchas cosas pasaron.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.20,0:08:42.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm sorry I couldn't meet up with you that day.}Lamento no haber{no haberme encontrado} estado contigo ese día.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.29,0:08:49.21,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.67,0:08:54.63,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{That's right. Kou has a lot of stuff going on in his life.}Cierto. Muchas cosas pasaron en la vida de Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.63,0:08:56.97,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{A lot more than I have to worry about.}Mucho más de lo que me pasó a mí.{~}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.64,0:08:59.89,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{And still, I...}Sin embargo, yo...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.02,0:09:02.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry.}Perdón.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.18,0:09:05.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I've been really insensitive.}Fui muy insensible al hacer tantas preguntas.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.10,0:09:06.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's okay.}Está bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.32,0:09:11.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's go home.}Vayamos a casa.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.94,0:09:14.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sure.}Sí.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.55,0:09:34.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Well, my house is this way.}Bueno, mi casa es por este lado.{este camino}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.17,0:09:35.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Alright.}Claro.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.43,0:09:39.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.14,0:09:43.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Are you excited for dinner tonight?}¿Estás emocionado por la cena de esta noche?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.43,0:09:44.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why?}¿Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.10,0:09:46.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What do you mean, "why"?}¿Qué quieres decir con "eh"?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.02,0:09:49.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Tanaka-sensei's going over to cook for you, isn't he?}Tanaka-sensei cocinará para ti, ¿no es así?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.02,0:09:52.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Man, I almost forgot he was coming.}Ah, cierto. Dijo que iba a venir.{ir}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.44,0:09:55.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Have fun! Bye-bye!}¡Diviértete!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.36,0:09:56.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.37,0:10:04.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{That was great! Kou told me more about himself.}¡Qué feliz estoy!{eso escucho} ¡Kou me contó más sobre él!
