Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.86,0:10:42.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Your big brother's waiting for you.}Tu hermano espera por ti.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.49,0:10:45.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And I always will be.}Y siempre lo hará.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.10,0:11:08.27,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{That's right.}Es cierto.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.98,0:11:13.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Even if you lose something, all you have to do is make it again.}Aun si pierdes algo, solo tienes que intentarlo de nuevo.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.57,0:11:17.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'll be more careful from now on.}Seré más cuidadosa de ahora en adelante.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.28,0:11:21.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Starting today...}A partir de hoy...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.24,0:11:24.16,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...I'll remake it all from step one.}comenzaré desde cero.{~}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.70,0:11:28.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka... Yoshioka...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.08,0:11:30.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{There I am. Class 2 it is.}Ahí estoy. En la Clase 2.
