Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.55,0:11:44.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.02,0:11:51.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hell yeah! Murao!}¡Qué bien! ¡Murao!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.81,0:11:54.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We're in the same class again! Lookin' delante to it!}¡Estamos en la misma clase otra vez! ¡Demos lo mejor!{~}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.44,0:11:56.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sure.}Claro.{Dommo}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.52,0:12:00.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You said you didn't have any attachment to our class last year,}Dijiste que no tenías ningún \Nrecuerdo de la clase del año pasado,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.36,0:12:05.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{but I won't let you say that again after this year!}¡pero no volverás a decir eso \Ncuando termine este año, lo juro!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.75,0:12:12.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Looks like I got stuck in the class with all the hotheads.}Como que me ha tocado el grupo donde están todos los alborotadores.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.79,0:12:16.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.21,0:12:17.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yo.}{Qué onda.}Hola.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.55,0:12:22.76,AoHaru,,0,0,20,,{Hey, after school today...\an8}Oye, después de clases...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.67,0:12:22.76,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Why?}¿Por qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.76,0:12:27.30,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Kou and I... are in the same class?!}¡¿Kou y yo... en la misma clase?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.98,0:12:39.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Morning!}¡Buenos días!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.82,0:12:41.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Man, it's way too early.}Ah, es muy temprano.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.07,0:12:44.11,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm starting over.}Estoy empezando de nuevo.{algo diferente quedaría mejor, pero no se me ocurre nada ;_;}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.95,0:12:48.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm through with making shallow friends}Me cansé de no hacer amigos de verdad
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.87,0:12:50.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{and deceiving myself.}y de engañarme a mí misma.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.83,0:12:55.12,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Now that I'm in a new class, I'm going to rebuild everything from step one.}Ahora que estoy en una nueva clase, \Nempezaré desde cero.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.12,0:12:59.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, how's it feel to drop down to our class from the advanced track?}Oye, ¿qué se siente estar en nuestra clase cuando vienes de una avanzada?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.30,0:13:01.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What do you mean?}¿De qué hablas?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.59,0:13:06.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I bet you're pissed that you have to be in the same class as guys like us.}Seguro que estás cansado de estar con tipos como nosotros.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.22,0:13:12.43,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Man, could that question be any more laced with poison?}Rayos, ¿cómo puede hacerle una pregunta así?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.81,0:13:16.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why would it bother me? I'm not even all that smart.}¿Qué dices? No soy tan inteligente.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.02,0:13:22.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Back in middle school, I got really into studying for some reason.}Cuando estaba en secundaria,\N comencé a estudiar mucho sin razón alguna.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.99,0:13:25.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But when I tried to take a little break in high school,}Pero cuando intenté descansar un poco de tantos estudios,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.45,0:13:29.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{my grades fell right through the floor.}{mis calificaciones bajaron hasta el piso.}{se fueron al carajo}mis calificaciones se desplomaron.{Te~he~!}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:32.08,0:13:34.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Mabuchi, are you really Tanaka's brother?}Mabuchi, ¿en verdad eres el hermano de Tanaka?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.62,0:13:35.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah.}Sí.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.41,0:13:37.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You do look pretty similar.}Se parecen bastante.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.79,0:13:43.59,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Tiene una facilidad para mantener el ritmo de la conversación y que todo siga su curso.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.47,0:13:54.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's up?}¿Pasa algo?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.56,0:13:57.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, it's nothing.}Oh, no es nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.52,0:14:00.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{What are you, an elementary schooler?}¿Qué? ¿Eres de primaria?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.19,0:14:05.57,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm asking if you're an elementary schooler.}Me pregunto si es un chico de primaria.{sonríe pensando que puede ser el de antes xd}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.87,0:14:12.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Morning!}¡Buenos días!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.58,0:14:13.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Good morning.}Buenos días.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.49,0:14:15.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, see that girl right there?}Escucha, ¿ves a esa chica de ahí?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.33,0:14:20.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I heard the girls in her class all gave her the cold shoulder last year.}Oí por ahí que todas las chicas de su clase le dieron la espalda el año pasado.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.58,0:14:22.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What, why?}¿Qué? ¿Por qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.13,0:14:24.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Dunno, but there must've been a reason.}Ni idea, pero seguramente hubo un motivo.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.43,0:14:32.26,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{She's pretending that it doesn't bother her.}Finge que no le molesta.
