Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.85,0:14:36.56,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{People are so easily swayed.}Las personas se dejan llevar tan fácilmente.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.52,0:14:39.77,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Myself included.}Hasta yo lo hice.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.27,0:14:45.15,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{All I need to do is make it seem like Makita-san has friends!}¡Oh! ¡Pues puedo hacer que parezca que Makita-san tiene amigas!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.15,0:14:46.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, Makita-san!}¡Oye, Makita-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.15,0:14:50.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Take a look.}Mira esto.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.03,0:14:52.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's the one you gave me before.}Es el que me regalaste ese día.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.16,0:14:54.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You ended up using it.}Lo estás usando.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.41,0:14:56.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks!}¡Gracias!
