Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.12,0:15:01.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh? They're having a normal conversation.}¿Eh? Están teniendo una conversación normal.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.79,0:15:03.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I guess it wasn't her personality.}Supongo que su personalidad no es el problema.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.63,0:15:07.05,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Yes, going good! Just a bit more...}¡Sí, va bien! Solo un poco más...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.05,0:15:09.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Ah, it's her!}¡Ah, es ella!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.43,0:15:13.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I heard she got in a huge fight with some girls in her class last year.}Oí que tuvo una gran discusión con sus compañeras de clase el año pasado.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.43,0:15:14.93,thin straight hand,,0,0,0,,{\p1\blur1\c&HF2F0EE&\pos(630.096,92.762)\fscx113\fscy36}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.43,0:15:14.93,thin straight hand,,0,0,0,,{\c&H868482&\fs50\blur0.6\pos(634.667,100.667)}Ella
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.05,0:15:14.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So we should look out for her?}{kowaii}¿Entonces debemos cuidarnos de ella?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.93,0:15:16.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{She looks really rough, too.}Se ve muy complicada.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.64,0:15:17.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Is she a delinquent?}¿Será una delincuente?{yankee : D}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.89,0:15:19.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Seriously?}¿En serio?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.02,0:15:22.90,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm rough on purpose, but I'm no delinquent.}Parezco ser{kowai} complicada a propósito, \Npero no soy una delincuente.{Trato de dar miedo a propósito}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.90,0:15:26.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Wait, now they're going to isolate me instead!}¡Momento, ahora a quien harán a un lado es a mí!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.53,0:15:35.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Murao-san, g-good morning.}Murao-san, b-buenos días.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.66,0:15:38.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Morning.}Buenos días.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.16,0:15:42.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{She might be easier to talk to than I expected.}Parece que se puede hablar con ella mejor de lo que esperaba.
