Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.80,0:15:51.26,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{She shut me out completely!}¡Me ignoró completamente!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.26,0:15:52.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Murao!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.76,0:15:57.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Morning! What'cha reading? \NGot any good music playing?}¡Buenas! ¿Qué estás leyendo? ¿Qué estás escuchando?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.73,0:16:05.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Man, Lady Luck must love us if she put us in the same class again.}Vaya, qué suerte tenemos de estar de nuevo en la misma clase.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.73,0:16:09.53,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Please stop! Your fruitless advances remind me too much of myself!}¡Ya basta! ¡Esa manera de ser me recuerda a mí!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.53,0:16:14.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh yeah, and speaking of lucky, when I was at the convenience store the other day...}Ah, cierto, hablando de suerte, \Ncuando estaba en la tienda {de varios articulos sería?}el otro día...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.63,0:16:27.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's hard to make any moves.}{Es difícil poder avanzar.}{me suena a que no avanzó nada todavía como:} No pude hacer ningún avance.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.09,0:16:29.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So how's the new class?}¿Qué tal tu nueva clase?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.05,0:16:31.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, um...}Ah, eh...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.84,0:16:37.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Well, it's kind of all over the place.}Bueno, cómo decirlo, es un poco de todo.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.60,0:16:39.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why don't you try running for class rep?}¿Por qué no intentas ser la representante de la clase?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.81,0:16:40.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh?}¿Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.47,0:16:44.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm not exactly that type of person...}No, no soy ese tipo de persona...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.77,0:16:48.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{High school will be over before you know it.}Terminarás la preparatoria antes de que te des cuenta.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.77,0:16:52.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Get out there and try some things that you can only do now.}Ve e intenta cosas que solo podrás hacer ahora.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.29,0:17:02.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Easier said than done...}Es más fácil decirlo que hacerlo...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.37,0:17:03.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How gloomy.}Qué deprimente.{~}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.38,0:17:07.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.79,0:17:09.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Depressed already?}¿Deprimida otra vez?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.96,0:17:14.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I can't take my first step if I have nowhere to stand.}No puedo dar mi primer paso si no tengo dónde pararme.{~}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.01,0:17:19.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm already falling down the path to isolation.}Voy por el camino de quedar sola.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.39,0:17:24.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Well, I always knew how indecisive you were.}Bueno, siempre supe que eras indecisa.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.77,0:17:28.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That doesn't exactly cheer me up.}Eso no sirve para animarme.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.27,0:17:31.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And I never intended to.}Tampoco era esa mi intención.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.82,0:17:38.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You talked big about starting over from the first step, and you're like this in less than a day?}¿Hablaste de comenzar desde cero \Ny así es como terminas tu primer día?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.45,0:17:42.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Life wasted no time in showing me how powerless I am.}La vida no perdió tiempo en \Nmostrarme cuán impotente soy.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.00,0:17:46.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What does that matter?}¿Y qué importa?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.62,0:17:49.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,A nadie le importará que caigas tan fácilmente.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.84,0:17:55.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But on the flip side,}Pero por otro lado,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.84,0:17:59.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,tampoco a nadie le importará que lo sigas intentando.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.89,0:18:04.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I mean, it's not like anything's started for you yet.}Digo, no es que hayas comenzado nada aún.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.14,0:18:07.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just do what you want to do.}Simplemente haz lo que quieras hacer.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.10,0:18:12.02,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Nothing has started yet,}Nada ha comenzado todavía,{AHR#02: 0:23:25.76}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.02,0:18:13.57,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{nor have I started anything.}ni comencé nada.{AHR#02}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.61,0:18:18.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{If I really want to start something new,}Si en verdad quiero comenzar algo nuevo,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.36,0:18:21.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{then it shouldn't surprise me}no debería sorprenderme
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.70,0:18:25.41,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{that it'll take more than I've ever had to get moving.}que deba esforzarme más que nunca para que funcione.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:25.41,chalkboard2,,0,0,0,,{\c&HDAEBDC&\fsp1\fry-2\blur0.7\an6\fax-.3\frz16.05\move(844,58,903,58,20,3691)}Representante\N de la clase\h\h
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:25.41,chalkboard2,,0,0,0,,{\c&HDAEBDC&\fsp1\fry-2\blur0.7\an6\fax-.3\frz16.05\move(248,202,299,202,20,3691)}Planificación\Nde eventos\h\h
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.41,0:18:28.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Nobody's going to volunteer?}¿Ningún voluntario?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.79,0:18:37.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{If you don't decide soon, we'll be here all day.}Si nadie se decide, estaremos aquí todo el día.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:38.26,chalkboard2,,0,0,0,,{\fs15\blur0.5\an6\move(885,297,1073,297,25,5447)}Representante\N de la clase
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:38.26,chalkboard2,,0,0,0,,{\fs15\blur0.5\an6\move(758,297,949,297,25,5447)}Planificación\Nde eventos
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.05,0:18:38.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What?}¿Qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.26,0:18:40.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm the only one with any right to complain.}Soy el único que puede quejarse por eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.10,0:18:45.02,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{If I don't change,}Si no cambio,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.69,0:18:50.90,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{then I can't take that first step.}no podré dar el primer paso.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.27,0:18:54.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, Yoshioka!}¡Oh, Yoshioka!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.98,0:18:56.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You'll do it?}¿Lo harás?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.23,0:18:56.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yes!}¡Sí!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.36,0:19:00.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Then Yoshioka will be our female representative.}Entonces, Yoshioka será nuestra representante femenina.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.28,0:19:03.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yoshioka, take over from here.}Yoshioka, ven a hacerte cargo de esto.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.70,0:19:05.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Okay.}Voy.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.70,0:19:08.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I will...}¡Quiero...{AHR#02 [0:23:35.36]}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.04,0:19:11.42,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...start it!}comenzarlo!{AHR#03 [0:23:37.56]}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:18.42,chalkboard2,,0,0,0,,{\c&HDBE7DA&\blur0.6\pos(678.667,141)}Yoshioka \NFutaba
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.55,0:19:18.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Right, moving on...}Bien, entonces...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.42,0:19:22.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I think we should decide on our male representative.}Creo que debemos decidir quién será nuestro representante masculino.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.39,0:19:24.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Any volunteers?}¿Algún voluntario?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.89,0:19:33.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Anyone who wants to make this class more fun with me!}¡Alguien que quiera hacer esta clase más divertida conmigo!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.56,0:19:34.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Please raise your hand!}¡Por favor!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.65,0:19:37.48,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Guess it's up to me...}Supongo que tendré que hacerlo...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.28,0:19:40.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I guess I'll do it.}Yo lo haré.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.49,0:19:44.41,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,¡Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.45,0:19:50.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{If there are no objections, Mabuchi-kun gets the position.}Si no hay nada que objetar,\N Mabuchi-kun ocupará esa posición.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.67,0:19:57.05,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I was a second too late...}Me ganó por un segundo...{KB}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.05,0:20:00.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Mabuchi-kun, please come up and assist me.}Mabuchi-kun, por favor, ven a ayudarme.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.93,0:20:03.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou, good luck.}Suerte, Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.30,0:20:05.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What is it?}¿Qué pasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.77,0:20:10.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks.}Gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.81,0:20:15.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Stupid. I just wanted to finish this up quick and go home.}Tonta. Simplemente lo hice porque quiero volver rápido a casa.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.90,0:20:17.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's get this done already.}Hagamos esto de una buena vez.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.61,0:20:20.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We need three event planners.}Necesitamos tres organizadores de eventos.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.69,0:20:22.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Anyone wanna do it?}¿Alguien quiere?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.91,0:20:26.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll be one.}Yo lo haré.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.49,0:20:28.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.33,0:20:29.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You'll really do it?}¿En serio lo harás?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.75,0:20:32.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks, you'll be a huge help!}¡Gracias{~me encanta esta seiyuu<3}, serás de gran ayuda!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:34.79,0:20:37.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Alright, two to go.}Muy bien, faltan dos.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.18,0:20:45.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Murao-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.39,0:20:48.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll be an event planner.}Yo quiero ser parte de esto.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.39,0:20:54.44,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{If Murao-san's in, then the last spot has to go to...}Si está Murao-san, entonces el próximo será...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.60,0:20:56.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Here!}¡Aquí!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.23,0:20:59.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll be the last event planner!}¡Yo seré el que falta!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.23,0:21:00.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I knew it.}Lo sabía.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.12,0:21:16.58,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{That finished pretty quickly. But seriously, what a strange bunch we are.}Eso fue rápido. Pero en serio, qué grupo tan raro se formó.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.00,0:21:22.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Good. You class reps and event planners will need to attend a leadership course.}Bueno. Los representantes y organizadores deberán asistir a clases de liderazgo.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.55,0:21:24.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Leadership course?}¿Clases de liderazgo?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.38,0:21:28.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's an overnight course. Tanaka-sensei will be leading it.}Son clases nocturnas.\N Tanaka-sensei estará a cargo.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.60,0:21:38.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's with that look? Got something to say?}¿Qué tanto miras? ¿Tienes algo que decir?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.40,0:21:40.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{N-Not really.}N-No realmente.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.07,0:21:43.32,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{It's starting.}Está comenzando.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.28,0:21:45.57,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm starting it!}¡Estoy comenzando!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.57,0:21:47.49,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{This is something I can only do now.}Es algo que solo podré hacer ahora.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.28,0:21:52.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Only at this moment, only with these people!}¡Solo{kyu, solo} en este momento, y con estas personas!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.92,0:23:39.94,next time,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HDFB045&\bord4.5\blur4.88\3c&HE6BB2E&\pos(219.429,138.571)\fscx75\b0}Siguiente episodio...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.92,0:23:39.94,next time,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HDFB045&\bord2.5\blur2.88\3c&HE6BB2E&\pos(219.429,138.571)\fscx75\b0}Siguiente episodio...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.92,0:23:39.94,next time,,0,0,0,,{\bord0.25\blur0.5\c&HFFFEF9&\pos(219.429,138.571)\fscx75\b0\3c&HFFFFF5&}Siguiente episodio...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:27.01,0:23:29.17,AoHaru,,0,550,0,,{When we look back on this,}Cuando miremos atrás,
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.72,0:23:32.26,AoHaru,,0,550,0,,{I want everyone who shared this experience}quiero que todos los que compartieron esta experiencia
Dialogue: 10,0:23:33.22,0:23:37.27,AoHaru,,0,550,0,,{\q2\to remember these warm and fun times.}recuerden lo cálido y divertido que fue.
